  "description": "Blending the responsiveness of our Reactor road race frame with the versatile handling and confidence of the Great Divide, the Aurora is our range-topping model for all occasions.\n\nA top priority when developing the Aurora was to balance high stiffness and crisp handling with all-day comfort levels that only titanium can deliver. Despite an overall stiffness level approaching our race-specific Reactor model, the Aurora is the smoothest riding frame we offer. A combination of carefully shaped and butted tubing, svelte seat stays and the one-piece carbon seat mast result in a frame that smooths vibration like nothing else on the road.\n\nFULLY BUTTED TUBESET TO SHAVE GRAMS AND TUNE THE RIDE QUALITY\n\nCUSTOM MACHINED TITANIUM HEAD TUBES AND HEAD SETS FOR PRECISE HANDLING AND A SEAMLESS LOOK (FULLY INTEGRATED VERSION SHOWN)\n\nCUSTOM MACHINED TITANIUM HEADSETS COMPLETE WITH ENDURO STAINLESS BEARINGS ARE NOW A STANDARD OFFERING ON ALL FRAMESETS.\n\nCUSTOM FILAMENT WOUND MULTI-LAYERED CARBON SEAT MAST\n\nFUTURE-PROOFED UDH 3D SINTERED GRADE 5 SEAMLESS TITANIUM DROP-OUTS\n\nLIGHTWEIGHT NO. 6 COMPOSITES CARBON FORK INCREASES TIRE CLEARANCE WHILE MAINTAINING PERFORMANCE ORIENTED GEOMETRY\n\nT47 BOTTOM BRACKET FOR MAXIMUM STIFFNESS AND A TIME-TESTED THREADED INTERFACE\n\nCUSTOM MACHINED BRAKE BRIDGE WITH OPTIONAL CONCEALED FENDER MOUNT\n\nA COMPLETE ARRAY OF PROPRIETARY NO. 22 | PROTOTIPO WORKS HARDWARE\n\n3D SINTERED GRADE 5 SEAT MAST TOPPER IN MULTIPLE OFFSETS",
